title: HomeIntro
---
<<declare $brotherName = "Art">>
<<declare $dadName= "Zoran">>
<<declare $momName= "Dafina">>

As {$protagName} walks into his house, he spots {$brotherName} standing in the kitchen.

//display Art
<<oneChar>>
<<changeSprite 1 0>>
<<lighten 1>>
{$brotherName}: Oh, hey, Marc. 
A sly smirk grows over {$brotherName}'s face.
{$brotherName}: You like the coffee I left for you this morning?
-> Yeah, my hand really loved the hot water.
    <<darken 1>>
    {$protagName}: Yeah, my hand really loved the hot water.
    <<lighten 1>>
    {$brotherName}: The water burned you?.
    <<darken 1>>
    {$protagName}: Only a little.
    <<lighten 1>>
    {$brotherName}: Sorry, I didn't mean for that to happen.
    <<darken 1>>
    {$protagName}: It's OK, {$brotherName}. Don't worry about it.
-> Thanks for thinking about me.
    <<darken 1>>
    {$protagName}: Thanks for thinking about me.
    <<lighten 1>>
    {$brotherName}: Glad you liked it.
    <<darken 1>>
    {$protagName}: How could I not?
-> You're an idiot.
    <<darken 1>>
    {$protagName}: You're an idiot.
    <<lighten 1>>
    {$brotherName} scoffs.
    {$brotherName}: Damn, alright then.
    <<darken 1>>
    {$protagName}: I'm just kidding. Just make sure you don’t leave the stove unattended, OK?
    <<lighten 1>>
    {$brotherName}: OK.
<<lighten 1>>
{$brotherName}: So, how was your first day? Was it everything you dreamed it would be?
-> Tell Art about Jovan and Ruzica
    <<darken 1>>
    <<changeStat 0 3>>
    {$protagName}: I spoke with Jovan and Ruzica {$loverLastName}.
    {$protagName}: They're friends with my boss and live in his neighborhood.
    {$protagName}: Their story was...actually pretty depressing.
    <<lighten 1>>
    {$brotherName}: Oh, I've seen Mr. {$loverLastName}, and he has a picture of his wife on his desk. What did they tell you?
    <<darken 1>>
    {$protagName}: They lived in different parts of a city up North, back when it was strictly segregated.
    {$protagName}: Jovan snuck out to be with Ruzica, which made everyone really upset.
    {$protagName}: They burned down Jovan's house and killed his cousin, and the two of them had to leave the city.
    <<lighten 1>>
    {$brotherName}: Oh. That sounds... kinda bad.
    <<darken 1>>
    {$protagName}: Understatement of the century.
-> Don't tell Art about Jovan and Ruzica
    <<darken 1>>
    {$protagName}: I spent my day at a museum, so not totally terrible.
    <<lighten 1>>
    {$brotherName}: Doesn't sound like much fun.
    <<darken 1>>
    {$protagName}: Don't worry about it. 
    <<wait 1>>
    {$protagName}: Just don't get into trouble. For me. Please.
<<wait 0.5>>
{$protagName}: Anyways, I also saw Officer {$officerName} today. Remember him?
{$brotherName} scowls.
<<lighten 1>>
{$brotherName}: Ugh, that cop. I don't like him.
<<darken 1>>
{$protagName}: C'mon, he's a good guy, and you know it.
<<lighten 1>>
{$brotherName}: Yeah, right.
<<darken 1>>
-> Talk about the town square incident
    <<changeStat 0 2>>
    {$protagName}: He came up to me before I came home.
    {$protagName}: It was crazy. While we were talking, this huge brawl started between these guys, arguing about sports.
    <<lighten 1>>
    {$brotherName}: Sounds about right. You know, sometimes some of my teammates get super intense about that kinda stuff too.
    <<darken 1>>
    {$protagName}: I get it. But you’re nothing like those delinquents.
    <<lighten 1>>
    {$brotherName}: Whatever.
-> Don't talk about the town square incident
    {$protagName}: You should respect him.
    <<lighten 1>>
    {$brotherName}: Whatever.
<<zeroChar>>
{$brotherName} walks away.

{$protagName}'s parents go to the kitchen to talk with him.
<<twoChar>>
<<changeSprite 1 1>>
<<changeSprite 2 0>>
<<darken 1>>
<<lighten 2>>
{$momName}: Hey, kiddo. How was your first day?
-> It was definitely...something.
    <<darken 2>>
    {$protagName}: It was definitely...something.
    <<lighten 1>>
    {$dadName} raises an eyebrow.
    {$dadName}: Already complaining?
    <<darken 1>>
    <<lighten 2>>
    {$momName}: Get to bed soon; you want to be rested for tomorrow.
    <<darken 2>>
-> It went as well as I would've imagined.
    <<darken 2>>
    {$protagName}: It went as well as I would've imagined.
    <<lighten 2>>
    {$momName}: Don’t worry so much about it. The museum is lucky to have you.
    <<darken 2>>
    <<lighten 1>>
    {$dadName}: {$momName}, he’s a grown man. There’s no need to reassure him.
    <<darken 1>>
-> Honestly, not bad at all.
    <<darken 2>>
    {$protagName}: Honestly, not bad at all. I’m actually looking forward to tomorrow.
    <<lighten 2>>
    {$momName}: It sounded perfect for you when you told us last week!
    {$momName}: I’m glad you have something to look forward to.
    <<darken 2>>
{$protagName} goes to his room.
<<changeBG 1>>
<<zeroChar>>
{$protagName} sits at his desk, thinking about everything that happened today.
===
